PTX tma-pipeline-war+wgmma+no-wait_group
"Variant of tma-pipeline-war+wgmma without wgmma.wait_group before the release: the wgmma read may still be in flight when the producer refills the stage. CUTLASS always waits first (sm90_mma_tma_gmma_ss_warpspecialized.hpp:547-551). Expected: allowed."
{
g=7;
d=5 @cta 0;
c=0 @cta 0;
e=mbarrier(1) @cta 0;
f=mbarrier(1) @cta 0;
P0:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                                                  | P1@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0              ;
 mbarrier.try_wait.parity.acquire.cta r0, e, 0                             | wgmma.fence.sync.aligned              ;
 mbarrier.arrive.expect_tx.release.cta f, 1                                | wgmma.mma_async.sync.aligned r1, d, c ;
 cp.async.bulk.shared::cluster.global.mbarrier::complete_tx::bytes d, g, f | wgmma.commit_group.sync.aligned       ;
                                                                           | mbarrier.arrive.release.cta e         ;
exists
(P0:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 7)
